{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:705","content":{"id":705,"title":"外观数列","content":[{"children":[{"text":"题目描述","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9708a157-19d3-4168-bfc7-d97581197734","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"给定一个正整数 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"n","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，输出外观数列的第 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"n","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 项。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"58610a83-9a63-410e-a0b4-10e086aac5b7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"「外观数列」是一个整数序列，从数字 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"1","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 开始，序列中的每一项都是对前一项的描述。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d1660e12-e7bb-4093-9ea7-00e78d6e48ab","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"你可以将其视作是由递归公式定义的数字字符串序列：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"dbaf41b3-0885-4580-8efd-e7f10450a20f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"countAndSay(1) = \"1\"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"78d869f6-6e00-4cde-b77b-99dc566dfadc","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"da018da8-b262-4c5b-8bd5-26f70123a86e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"countAndSay(n)","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是对 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"countAndSay(n-1)","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的描述，然后转换成另一个数字字符串。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7f0ca652-032b-4268-bd17-a0bd12995215","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"05fad889-19f6-4df5-b5e4-ef3820a38e78","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"769c8fec-3031-4da9-8ed0-f22374a43f99","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"前五项如下：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"da42be9b-df22-49b0-acf1-da724f241dd4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"1.     1\n2.     11\n3.     21\n4.     1211\n5.     111221\n第一项是数字 1 \n描述前一项，这个数是 1 即 \"一 个 1\"，记作 \"11\"\n描述前一项，这个数是 11 即 \"二 个 1\" ，记作 \"21\"\n描述前一项，这个数是 21 即 \"一 个 2 + 一 个 1\" ，记作 \"1211\"\n描述前一项，这个数是 1211 即 \"一 个 1 + 一 个 2 + 二 个 1\" ，记作 \"111221\"","collabId":"5cf06288-b310-4d17-8904-55b963b24a1d","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"fbef4f6e-d34b-4096-a5da-2ab993483737","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"e4e47a71-d032-4e4d-9071-f323a57dcdb9"},{"children":[{"text":"要描述一个数字字符串，首先要将字符串分割为最小数量的组，每个组都由连续的最多相同字符组成。然后对于每个组，先描述字符的数量，然后描述字符，形成一个描述组。要将描述转换为数字字符串，先将每组中的字符数量用数字替换，再将所有描述组连接起来。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a6706aae-ce1a-42c1-a056-ec142f8d2d85","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"示例：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f1e8bd81-9b9b-491c-9eea-5e1fceaa7261","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"输入：n = 4\n输出：\"1211\"","collabId":"e68661cf-8812-4286-8663-4bcb9fe2414b","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"eade275e-51ca-4ea4-938b-39d42f930902","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"e7085cf1-7806-4ca4-a8b1-94b117b76421"},{"children":[{"text":"解题思路","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"bd7fb349-3279-4d32-9dc8-69dc1b4b32f1","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"我们定义一个方法 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"describe","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，该方法接收一个字符串，返回对该字符串的描述，那么我们的总体思路如下","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"45f936f0-cf2c-4146-8967-24025b5f6673","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"public String countAndSay(int n) {\n    String str = \"1\";\n    for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n        str = describe(str);\n    }\n\n    return str;\n}","collabId":"fbd62a0a-3a34-45b8-9989-2dd4fb125036","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"69c9d5f6-f8e6-4997-9507-bb82f61ce353","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"8181d93f-ef7c-4e95-9aa0-296ac705ac61"},{"children":[{"text":"现在我们要实现 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"describe","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方法，我们定义两个指针 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"start","type":"formatted"},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"end","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"[start, end)","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 内的字符都是相同的，每次我们判断 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"str[end]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是否与 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"[start, end)","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 内的字符是否相同，如果相同，则将该字符添加进去，即 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"end++","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，如果不相同，统计有多少个相同字符 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"(end - start)","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，以 ","type":"formatted"},{"color":"#6425d0","darkColor":"#a472fc","text":"[字符个数][字符]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的形式添加到返回的字符串中，并更新 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"start","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e636b429-d744-416e-9834-a11fcb5edad8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"private String describe(String str) {\n    int start = 0;\n    int end = 1;\n    char[] chars = str.toCharArray();\n    StringBuilder stringBuilder = new StringBuilder();\n    while (end < str.length()) {\n        if (chars[start] != chars[end]) {\n            stringBuilder.append(end - start);\n            stringBuilder.append(chars[start]);\n            start = end;\n        }\n        end++;\n    }\n\n    stringBuilder.append(end - start);\n    stringBuilder.append(chars[start]);\n\n    return stringBuilder.toString();\n}","collabId":"8c08dbbd-b28e-43ba-b751-33c4f209bc26","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"b51d98af-a321-4a7d-8d27-7a9c77bb12f1","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"94308681-e025-4106-8814-8ba321e8d0cd"},{"children":[{"text":"参考","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"35df615a-45a8-4417-a2ba-234a9b0de556","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"外观数列","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c4942586-29c2-4885-9fe4-70401325d569","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/count-and-say/"}],"collabId":"d23f39ab-2261-4c21-9953-ee6f7efcb14b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"66659e31-0e33-44be-aff0-310a2e30d9cc","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"309b9d41-4a54-472a-bbb0-351ad44159bb","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"双指针"},{"label":"外观数列","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:705","type":"doc","id":705}}],"prevPage":{"title":"搜索旋转排序数组II","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:703","type":"doc","id":703}},"nextPage":{"title":"插入区间","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:726","type":"doc","id":726}},"createTime":1729001844540,"updateTime":1793532544375,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1793532544375}}